		<h3 class="card__title">
			<a href="https://cybelangel.com/blog/the-api-threat-report-2026/" class="card__link">
				The API Threat Report: What 2026 Has Taught Us So Far			</a>
		</h3>

					<p class="card__author">
				Orlaith Traynor			</p>
		
					<p class="card__time">
				<span class="span-reading-time rt-reading-time"><span class="rt-label rt-prefix"></span> <span class="rt-time"> 8</span> <span class="rt-label rt-postfix">min read</span></span>				•
