							<div class="item col-md-6 col-sm-12">
					<article class="card--post">
			<div class="card__image-container">
			<img src="https://cybelangel.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AfD-leak-cybersecurtiy_files-516x271.png" alt="AfD Email Leak: Hacktivism and European Political Unrest">
